  "thisWeek": {
    "title": "Week 1 — the re-entry week",
    "lede": "Deliberately gentle, and it leads with reviving what you already know — that's the fastest route back to \"oh right, I <strong>love</strong> this\".",
    "rows": [
      { "day": "Mon", "anchor": false, "html": "<b>Blackbird, first pass.</b> Expect rust — the first fumbling run-through is the worst it will ever sound again. It counts double." },
      { "day": "Tue", "anchor": true, "html": "<b>Electric Blues Lab #1.</b> 10 minutes on the pentatonic pattern 1 refresher (Blues Guitar &amp; Easy Improvisation, in the library), then Seven Nation Army at proper volume. End grinning." },
      { "day": "Wed", "anchor": false, "html": "<b>Tune the Dove to open D</b> (lesson in the library) and do slide foundations: one string, slow, slide directly over the fret wire. Ten minutes is plenty; strum the open tuning after — it sounds glorious with zero effort." },
      { "day": "Thu", "anchor": true, "html": "<b>Workshop: Blackbird, sectional.</b> Week 1's \"new song\" is a revival — slow work on whichever passage always wobbled." },
      { "day": "Fri", "anchor": false, "html": "<b>Free play</b> with the Guitar Comeback playlist on. Whatever your hands feel like." },
      { "day": "Sat", "anchor": false, "html": "<b>Blackbird, full runs</b> — plus any old favourite that surfaces on its own." },
      { "day": "Sun", "anchor": false, "html": "<b>15 min of slide</b>, then the 10-minute review: tick what you've nailed on the boards below and tell Claude." }
    ]
  },
